infiltrator-software (0.3.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Replace the Updates placeholder with live asynchronous APT update inventory.
  * Resolve and present the complete APT transaction before update execution.
  * Add a narrow Polkit-authorized update helper restricted to exact-version
    upgrades of packages that are already installed, with removals prohibited.
  * Add privileged package-list refresh and integrated Install all updates flow.
  * Add a Mint-native XApp panel update indicator with distinct up-to-date,
    orange update-available, checking, installing and red error states.
  * Autostart the panel indicator, keep it single-instance and start it when
    Software opens so existing installations do not require a new login.
  * Open Software directly on Updates from the panel indicator.
  * Package and verify the updater helper, Polkit policy, autostart entry,
    XApp runtime dependency and complete status-icon set in CI and releases.

